@startuml improvements
title Code Executor Sandbox - Design Review & Improvements

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam noteBorderColor #999999

' ==================== CURRENT vs IMPROVED ====================

package "Current Design" as current #LightGray {
    component "In-Memory Storage" as mem_current #LightCoral
    component "BackgroundTasks" as bg_current #LightCoral
    component "No Authentication" as no_auth #LightCoral
    component "Basic Health Check" as basic_health #LightYellow
    component "No Metrics" as no_metrics #LightCoral
    component "Cold Start Containers" as cold_start #LightYellow
}

package "Suggested Improvements" as improved #LightGreen {
    component "Redis/DB Storage" as redis_storage #LightGreen
    component "Celery/RQ Queue" as task_queue #LightGreen
    component "JWT/API Key Auth" as auth #LightGreen
    component "Full Health Check" as full_health #LightGreen
    component "Prometheus Metrics" as metrics #LightGreen
    component "Container Pool" as container_pool #LightGreen
}

' Arrows showing improvements
mem_current -right-> redis_storage : "Persistence\n& Scalability"
bg_current -right-> task_queue : "Reliability\n& Distribution"
no_auth -right-> auth : "Access Control"
basic_health -right-> full_health : "Docker+Queue\nStatus"
no_metrics -right-> metrics : "Observability"
cold_start -right-> container_pool : "Reduce Latency"

' ==================== IMPROVEMENT DETAILS ====================

note bottom of redis_storage
  **Benefits:**
  - Task persistence across restarts
  - Multiple server instances
  - Task history & audit trail
  - Faster than DB for streaming
end note

note bottom of task_queue
  **Benefits:**
  - Retry on failure
  - Task prioritization
  - Distributed workers
  - Dead letter queue
end note

note bottom of auth
  **Benefits:**
  - Per-user rate limits
  - Usage tracking
  - API key rotation
  - Audit logging
end note

note bottom of full_health
  **Check:**
  - Docker daemon alive
  - Redis connection
  - Worker count
  - Queue depth
  - Disk space
end note

note bottom of metrics
  **Track:**
  - Execution time histogram
  - Success/failure rates
  - Container lifecycle
  - Resource usage
  - Queue wait time
end note

note bottom of container_pool
  **Benefits:**
  - Pre-warmed containers
  - ~100ms vs ~500ms start
  - Reuse for same user
  - Graceful scaling
end note

' ==================== ROBUSTNESS OPTIONAL IMPROVEMENTS ====================

package "Robustness - Optional Improvements" as robustness_optional #LightBlue {
    component "Graceful Shutdown" as graceful_shutdown #LightBlue
    component "Task Cleanup" as task_cleanup #LightBlue
    component "Request Timeout" as request_timeout #LightSkyBlue
}

note bottom of graceful_shutdown
  **Priority: Medium**
  **Description:**
  - Wait for running tasks on shutdown
  - SIGTERM/SIGINT signal handling
  - Configurable shutdown timeout
  - Prevent task interruption
end note

note bottom of task_cleanup
  **Priority: Medium**
  **Description:**
  - Periodic cleanup of expired tasks
  - Prevent memory leaks
  - Configurable retention period
  - Background cleanup task
end note

note bottom of request_timeout
  **Priority: Low**
  **Description:**
  - API request-level timeout
  - Prevent long-running requests
  - Return 504 on timeout
  - Configurable per endpoint
end note

@enduml
